<title>FRANCE: Saudi Arabia seeks one mln T feed barley -trade.</title>
<headline>Saudi Arabia seeks one mln T feed barley -trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia will tender on Tuesday for one million tonnes of feed barley of optional origin, European grain traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The barley is for delivery in September and October.</p>
</text>
